    "long_instructions": "## Add Tree 1\r\nGoal: Put Tree 1 on your map. Compare it to your \"If ..., then ...\" rule from Define Stop 4.\r\n\r\n1. Drag your Data Scientist to **Define Stop 5**.\r\n2. Click the zoom **+** in the bottom corner of the map.\r\n3. Open your **Backpack**. Click **+** next to the file that ends in **base-tree**.\r\n4. Drag the picture into the \"Add Tree 1 from your Backpack\" box. Drag a corner to make it bigger.\r\n5. Trace your user's path on Tree 1. Check that it ends at the prediction you wrote in **Tree 1** in your guide.\r\n6. Finish the sentence: \"My rule and Tree 1 are alike or different because ...\"\r\n\r\nYou are done when Tree 1 is on your map and Define Stop 5 has an answer.",
